# Kapowarr — comic book manager.
#
# No secrets are required. PUID/PGID/TZ are inlined in compose.yaml; this file
# documents the runtime identity for reference only. Copying it to .env is
# optional and only needed if you switch to file-based variable substitution.
#
# PUID/PGID must match the shared media identity (host 1000:1000) so Kapowarr
# can write its download staging area (/app/temp_downloads) and the Kavita
# comics root (/comics).
#
# PUID=1000
# PGID=1000
# TZ=Etc/UTC
#
# qBittorrent credentials are entered in the Kapowarr UI after deployment and
# must never be stored here, in compose.yaml, in documentation, or in git.
# No qBittorrent client configuration belongs in this file.
